OL,3,APrince Harry and Meghan land in UK
OL,4,
OL,5,FThe Duke and Duchess of Sussex have
OL,6,Farrived back in the UK, BBC News
OL,7,Funderstands.
OL,9,FPrince Harry, Meghan and their children
OL,10,FArchie and Lilibet are believed to have
OL,11,Fflown into the country privately from
OL,12,FCalifornia.
OL,14,FA spokesman for the Duke and Duchess of
OL,15,FSussex said "this is not something we
OL,16,Fwould comment on".
OL,18,FLast week, it was reported that the
OL,19,Fcouple would be relocating to the UK in
OL,20,FAugust. They will not return to
OL,21,Fofficial duties but will live in
OL,22,FBritain as non-working royals.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
